cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Can GB Battery Declarations Be Audited From Public Data? (Dispatch Realisation of GB Batteries)"
abstract: >-
  A physics audit of GB battery MDO/MDB declarations under Grid Code GC0166,
  from public data only. Each BM unit's declarations are checked against its
  own metered energy (B1610). Version 1 locks the pre-registration before any
  unit is scored; per-unit results go privately to lead parties, and fleet-level
  results, the method and the pipeline are published.
